{
  "id": "pf2e-npc-attitudes",
  "title": "PF2e NPC Attitudes",
  "description": "<p>Tracks how the people the party has met feel about them. The GM sets each NPC's attitude, from Hostile to Helpful, marks who the party has met, sorts them into groups (a group can follow a Campaign Trackers reputation) and applies Make an Impression results. Players get a People window with portraits, the name they know each NPC by, their attitude and shared party notes.</p>",
  "version": "2.0.0",
